<title>USA: Handy &amp; Harman to buy back 1.8 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Handy &amp; Harman to buy back 1.8 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Handy &amp; Harman said it will buy back 1.8 million shares of common stock, at $18.75 a share, in accordance with its self-tender offer, which expired November 21.</p>
<p>The shares represent about 13 percent of the company's 13.8 million shares outstanding immediately prior to the offer, first made Oct. 22.</p>
<p>The company said the final proration factor for the buyback was 45.48 percent.</p>
</text>
